# Switch Submode

## Summary
Host command — navigate the UI to another submode. Possible values for submode are . Available to
cards and commands via the runtime loader, and to AI assistant rooms as a
tool.

## Example
```ts
import SwitchSubmodeTool from '@cardstack/boxel-host/commands/switch-submode';

let result = await new SwitchSubmodeTool(commandContext).execute({
  /* input fields */
} as any);
```
`commandContext` comes from `@context.commandContext` inside any card
format. In an AI room the same tool is invoked by name (action verb: Switch).
